          ],
          "sectionId": 22618
        }
      ],
      "title": "废墟王座·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22619001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "砰砰——咻，一枪爆头！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "呀嘿，你也想尝尝这个吗，伯莱塔7.62mm——微缩款~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "哈莉！优纪！是优纪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "别吵别吵，三个，四个，五个，正中红心~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "哈莉！是优纪，真的是优纪！优纪和江花迦出来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "欸……啊哈，我就知道你们会没事！\n队长，队长——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜呜……太好了，吓死我了，还以为再也见不到你们了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "好在有惊无险，也算是皆大欢喜了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这么说，小拉斐尔还是有两把刷子的嘛？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呸呸呸，都怪我这个乌鸦嘴……说什么「一定没事」……还有「幸福到掉眼泪」什么的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "没事就好，这里有我们，你们先到掩体后休息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个救我们出来的……白头发的女孩子……她在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "就在那边……欸，啊嘞？\n明明刚刚还在跟鲱鱼罐头打架的……人呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22619014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "奇怪……好像哪里都看不到她呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-493",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "blackyouji",
          "rowIds": [
            22619001,
            22619002,
            22619003,
