      ],
      "title": "废墟王座·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22621001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "那是什么意思……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你能感觉到「她」，对吧？她的记忆，她的情感……和你所缺失的，她的一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "真可悲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "从后门撤离，快——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呼……终于呼吸到新鲜的空气了……阿！\n是巨龙……我们被包围了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我「离乡的囚鸟」，我「替罪的羔羊」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "醒来吧，记起你是「谁」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "当然，我知道你来这，是为了一个自己不曾拥有过的名字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "「优纪」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "为什么……我是谁……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "镇定，蒂娅，冷静分析……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我们来了，头儿——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "看起来没有发生打斗，让那家伙跑了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "他已经走了，你们那边的情况呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "基本稳定，「天启」的杂兵已经被我们收拾干净，剩下三成正在四处逃命呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "危机解除，我们去跟大家汇合吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "还以为能看到一场超规格的终极对决呢，真可惜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22621018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "是啊，我的游记也少了浓墨重彩的一笔呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-495",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "blackyouji",
          "rowIds": [
            22621001,
