        }
      ],
      "title": "废墟王座·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22622001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "今天真的非常感谢各位。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "谢谢，谢谢大家，谢谢你们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "唔，区区举手之劳，你们也不用这么感激涕零。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "再次感谢大家……对不起大家……连累大家到了这么晚……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "阿，已经这么晚了……万一主人回到家发现我们都不见了的话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "人类是脆弱的生物，让重要的人类担惊受怕可不行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "我的小龙和阿斯塔罗斯可以带你们一程，至于其他人嘛……就各回各家好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "那我就带我的人先走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "我们也告辞了，请大家路上小心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "诸位，再会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "谢谢，谢谢大家今天来帮忙，\n到时候周年庆宴，一定要来玩呀~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "呼~皆大欢喜，皆大欢喜——\n今天的委托总算完成了，头儿，我们也走吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "——头儿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "请……等一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "谢谢你今天救了我……你……我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "没关系。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "（她笑了……虽然看起来冷冰冰的，但这种温暖又熟悉的感觉……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我……你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "（糟糕……又是什么话都说不出口的情况了……呜呜呜……优纪真是个大笨蛋！！！）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "哎我说，别让我的人类等太久。\n那个叫蒂娅的，你们有什么悄悄话，在我的小龙背上说好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的可以吗——谢谢龙王大人~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对了，内个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我叫「优纪」，还没问过呢……你的名字……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "蒂娅。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "「蒂娅」，我记住了，真是个好听的名字~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "内个，「蒂娅」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "嗯，怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔……其实也没什么啦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我想说……遇见你真的太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22622031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "嗯，我也是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
